          "list": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">The default profile is for an Institute laser pistol. An Institute laser can accept one each of the following mods. Any Stock mods change the weapon to an Institute laser rifle.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\"><strong>Capacitor:</strong> @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.ZwY8K4mRmwLwNcSE]{Photon Exciter}</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.WmZ06bzwzSsmRhHh]{Beta Wave Tuner}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.9wWBjcAJvxzgAa9c]{Boosted Capacitor}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.aqD7umOFLASYslWg]{Photon Agitator}</span></p>\n<p><strong><span class=\"fontstyle3\">Barrel:</span></strong> <span class=\"fontstyle3\">@Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.6py6TtlkeywhWQl1]{Long Barrel}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.fN4Om6m8QwAkLgVS]{Automatic Barrel}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.yRV0OZKqZpjBZ0eJ]{Improved Barrel}</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle3\"><strong>Stock:</strong> @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.Xiya2cq2V9TZ0UFC]{Standard Stock}</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle3\"><strong>Sights:</strong> @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.WZAnlfreDNUAaX4Y]{Reflex Sight}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.9IW2T8sgBoIzzxn8]{Short Scope}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.0mBcFGCDPdhVRPsP]{Long Scope}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.aQLTpQYLnuRen9xP]{Short Night Vision Scope}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.HXoyLcCUhPOtbnse]{Long Night Vision Scope}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.K8ZOSxg9heUurjsM]{Recon Scope}</span></p>\n<p><strong><span class=\"fontstyle3\">Muzzle: </span></strong><span class=\"fontstyle3\">@Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.yUZZMAoSuAyyyryF]{Beam Splitter Muzzle}</span>, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.iBg22gDv2OpisVJc]{Beam Focuser Muzzl